message: "If you use these materials, please cite them as below."
title: "Ticket Zero: A Live Prompt-Injection CTF for AI Assistant Security (IEEE CARS 2026 Workshop)"
abstract: >-
  Workshop materials and an interactive, real-time capture-the-flag application
  for the IEEE CARS 2026 workshop "Cybersecurity in the Age of AI Assistants:
  What Everyone Should Know". Participants attack a simulated support-desk agent
  through prompt injection, then switch sides and defend it.
